Subject: drm/msm/dpu: align Piano QSEED 2x sampling across pipe splits

Use preload seven for linear unrotated RGB on Piano QSEED 3.4 and fetch the next source pixel at internal splits. Program alpha top/bottom pixel extension from the vertical configuration, and retain full modesets when desktop geometry changes.

Link: https://github.com/slwyts/Project-SunUEFI/commit/c543e4b316f551396913469468459aa3780e319c
Link: https://github.com/slwyts/Project-SunUEFI/commit/2a2635fb88ee4014e1dab2c3aa5f586a29da3c3f

Use fractional sampling for downscaling as well as upscaling. Use the full source and destination dimensions when calculating the ratios.

Assisted-by: LLM
